#*
#*   Modification History:
#*      98/12/15 SDJ	: Modified from cdPrepRunGear-33
#*	99/02/24 SDJ	: Data directory now expected to be prepared
#*			  instead of preparing it.  Consequently logic
#*			  and command line args changed.
#*	99/03/04 SDJ	: Count number of files with find instead of ls.
#*	99/03/14 SDJ	: Improved error reporting.
#*	99/03/26 SDJ	: Added displaying of results to xterm.
#*	99/04/07 SDJ	: Added support for relative paths.
#*			  Added more useful error reporting.
#*	99/04/15 SDJ  	: Added -x flag to csh
#*	99/04/29 SDJ	: Fixed relative path code.
#*	99/09/28 SDJ	: Added disk space check.
#*    2000/02/03 SDJ	: Added check Num extents vs. extents written.
#*
